    "title": "Gassaway Days Committee calls on local business owners to help transform town | News | wvnews.com",
    "text": "GASSAWAY, W.Va. — The Gassaway Days Committee is calling on local business owners to help transform the town into a festive hub of history and patriotism this summer as the community prepares for a historic double anniversary.\nThis year marks the 50th anniversary of the Gassaway Days celebration, a milestone that coincides with the 250th birthday of the United States. To honor both occasions, organizers are encouraging the local business community to participate by decorating storefronts, windows, and public spaces.",
